          "name": "Create Setup Intent",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create Setup Intent",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint creates a setup intent against a previously created payment method. The setup intent is used to orchestrate the process that allows a customer to set up their payment method (e.g. debit card) for future usage in off-session payments. It returns a session token that may be passed to the <super-card> Web Component to begin the setup process.",
